		(property "Note" "CL 8 pF, +/-10 ppm, 2.0x1.6x0.5 mm. Nordic's BOM says a 2-pad 2016 and KiCad ships no 2-pin 2016 land pattern, so the 4-pad symbol is used and the can is grounded - better RF practice anyway. Recorded as a substitution. MPN completed to the orderable suffix 2026-09-05."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(layer "B.SilkS")
			(hide yes)
